ser. A real phone test is still needed; that is a different check."}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"With a VR headset"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Open this site’s HTTPS link in a compatible headset browser. ",["$","b",null,{"children":"Enter VR"}]," appears in the menu when immersive WebXR is available."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Hold the trigger over an object to grab, then release. Hold over clear ground and release on the ring to move. Small controls below your view operate the lights, return you home and exit VR."}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Headset testing is pending."}]," This is implemented support, not a verified claim that every headset works. Camera-driven jumping and resting are disabled in VR; your own head controls the view."]}]]}]]}]]}]
12:["$","section",null,{"id":"review","className":"guide-review","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-eyebrow","children":"THE HONEST REVIEW"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["The good parts.",["$","br",null,{}],"The rough edges."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-review-lead","children":"These are judgments from a reviewer who knew which model made each room. Later rooms also had more instructions, feedback, assets and time. This is not a blind or controlled test."}],["$","details",null,{"className":"guide-grade-reveal","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Show the room grades ",["$","span",null,{"children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-score-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01 · SPARK, ORIGINAL DELIVERY"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":["38",["$","small",null,{"children":"/100"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Too much was broken."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Some controls worked, but dragging failed, geometry was misplaced and opening it needed help. The repaired copy does not raise the original score."}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"02 · ASTRA, ORIGINAL DELIVERY"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":["89",["$","small",null,{"children":"/100"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"A strong decorating demo."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Selection, colour, movement and rotation worked well. Small screens needed scrolling. This was a quick-demo grade, not a commercial-game grade."}]]}],["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"03 · HOLLYHOCK, REVISED BRIEF"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":["63",["$","small",null,{"children":"/100"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Warmer, but still a dollhouse."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Familiar objects and colours add character. The stylized geometry, cutaway setting and limited interaction miss the requested immersive realism."}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"guide-score-new","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"04 · RETREAT, STRICT GAME RUBRIC"}],["$","strong",null,{"children":["66",["$","small",null,{"children":"/100"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Progress, with real limits."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Walking, grabbing, a hinged book and flexible pages are a substantial step. Contact quality, polish and real-device verification still fall short of AA/AAA expectations."}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-fine","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Two different standards:"}]," the first three scores use the demo rubric below. Room four uses the tougher game rubric requested later. Its 66 cannot be ranked directly against the original Astra’s 89."]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"How the original demo scores were counted"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-scroll","children":["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Working behaviour / brief / beginner use / appearance / delivery"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Room"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Working /40"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Brief /20"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Beginner /20"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Visual /15"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Delivery /5"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Spark"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"18"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"12"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"5"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"3"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"0"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Astra original"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"38"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"20"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"15"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"12"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"4"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Hollyhock"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"29"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"9"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"12"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"10"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"3"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"The retreat’s tougher rubric"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-rubric","children":[["$","div","Visual quality",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":["Visual quality",["$","b",null,{"children":[17,"/",25]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Scanned furniture and a complete interior help. The landscape, small props and lighting still lack the consistency of a finished game."}]]}],["$","div","Controls & interactions",{"children":["$L15","$L16"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19"]}],"$L1a"]}]]}],"$L1b"]}]
13:["$","section",null,{"className":"guide-explain","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-eyebrow","children":"WHAT CHANGED BETWEEN THE ATTEMPTS?"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":["The settings are only",["$","br",null,{}],"part of the story."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-explain-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Different model"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Spark and Astra are different AI models. Both are AI, just as free chatbots are AI too."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Different effort"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Light requests lighter reasoning. Ultra requests deeper work and can use AI helpers. More effort gives opportunities to improve; it does not guarantee a good result."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Fast is separate"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Fast is a processing-speed option. It doesn’t mean a large project finishes immediately or turns a sketch into a finished game."}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-fine","children":["The first two started with the same decorating request. The later cabins had a richer brief, repeated corrections and imported models and textures. We cannot isolate which setting caused each difference. ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/models","children":"Models & effort"}]," · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/agent-configuration/speed","children":"Fast mode"}]]}]]}]
14:["$","footer",null,{"className":"guide-footer","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"A little experimenting, at your own pace."}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Credits, repairs & honest limits"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Room pictures are captures of the actual demos. Scanned furniture, forest assets and material textures in the retreat come from ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://polyhaven.com","children":"Poly Haven"}]," under CC0. The floral paper and motorcycle print were AI-generated. Geometry, interactions and the guide were developed with AI assistance."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["The retreat uses ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://rapier.rs/docs/user_guides/javascript/getting_started_js/","children":"Rapier"}]," for rigid objects and a small cloth/page solver based on ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://matthias-research.github.io/pages/publications/XPBD.pdf","children":"XPBD"}],". It is not a production cloth system. Water is animated scenery. Furniture is not all movable. There is no audio track."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Detailed mode contains genuine 4K oak and sofa textures; other assets have lower resolution. Neither “4K” nor more polygons guarantees photorealism. There is no 8K or AAA claim."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["All scores are approximate, non-blind judgments, including the guide’s self-review. No physical phone or headset has been verified in this review. ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/archive/spark-original.html","children":"Spark’s preserved original"}]," includes the startup repair needed to view it; later control repairs are only in the playable copy."]}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#rooms","children":"Back to the rooms ↑"}]]}]
