1a:["$","p",null,{"className":"guide-fine","children":"AA and AAA are production categories, not standardized quality certificates. Here, 90+ would require exceptional visual consistency, reliable interactions and sustained performance on the promised devices. Unknown results do not receive full credit. This build has not met that bar."}]
